==== OpenWrt installation using the TFTP method and serial console access ====

As a fallback to easy installation one can install OpenWrt over serial console. This means the case needs to be opened, which will void your warranty !
    - Prepare a TFTP server with the OpenWrt *initramfs-kernel.bin and assign an IP from 10.90.90.0/24 (except 10.90.90.90, which is the switch's IP) to your PC's network port
    - Connect this network port to one of switch's ports
    - Connect to the serial console (115200 baud) and power on the switch
    - Press the ESC key once you see "Hit Esc key to stop autoboot" in the console output
    - Press CTRL+C keys to get into the real U-Boot prompt
    - Init the network with the command <code>rtk network on</code>
    - Load the OpenWrt image with the command <code>tftpboot 0x8f000000 <ipofyournetworkport>:<openwrtimagename></code> (''<ipofyournetworkport''> is your network port's IP, e.g. 10.90.90.100; ''<openwrtimagename>'' is the name of the image provided by the TFTP server)
    - Boot the OpenWrt image with the command <code>bootm</code>
    - Browse to ''<nowiki>https://192.168.1.1/cgi-bin/luci/admin/system/flash</nowiki>''
    - Upload the the OpenWrt ''*squashfs-sysupgrade.bin'' to the switch
    - Wait for it to reboot

==== OpenWrt additional installation methods ====
[[:toh:d-link:dgs-1210-16_g1#d-link_dgs-1210_rev_g_f_realtek]]
There are other installation methods for the dgs-1210 family but only the above method is tested and is known to work reliably on DGS-1210-10MP.

One user has reported success on the DGS-1210-10MP F1 running firmware earlier than 6.20, by following [[:toh:d-link:dgs-1210-16_g1#openwrt_easy_installation|DGS-1210 family OpenWrt easy installation]]: first flashing stock firmware version [[https://ftp.dlink.de/dgs/dgs-1210/archive/driver_software/DGS-1210-10MP_fw_revF_6-20-B009_eu_en_20200907.zip|6.20.B009]] to both slots, then booting into slot2 and flashing slot1 with [[https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/targets/realtek/rtl838x/openwrt-realtek-rtl838x-d-link_dgs-1210-10mp-f-squashfs-factory_image1.bin|openwrt-realtek-rtl838x-d-link_dgs-1210-10mp-f-squashfs-factory_image1.bin]]
