==== Buttons ====
The D-Link DGS-1210-10MP has the following buttons:

^ BUTTON  ^ Event          ^
| Reset   |  Reboot/reset  |
| Mode    |  Not active    |

The Mode button are supposed to shift the port LED between showing PoE status or Link status but the Mode button is not implemented.

